msgid "Phone"
msgstr ""

msgid "Calls are carried by the mobile network (VoLTE) and handed to a Bluetooth headset and/or SIP phones on this device. This page configures the SIP accounts, where calls go, and the audio path. Changes take effect as soon as they are applied; a call in progress is not interrupted."
