msgid "Run the IMS data service"
msgstr ""

msgid "Lets the modem register for VoLTE. Without it the modem has no IMS data connection and calls fall back to the circuit-switched network (which this device does not have on 4G)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Where calls go"
msgstr ""

msgid "Bluetooth headset and SIP phones"
msgstr ""

