msgstr ""

msgid "SIP phones only"
msgstr ""

msgid "Answer on the device, no audio routing"
msgstr ""

msgid "Auto-answer after (seconds)"
msgstr ""

msgid "0 never answers by itself."
msgstr ""

msgid "Manage auto-answer"
msgstr ""

msgid "Stops the ModemManager auto-answer service while this daemon runs, so the two cannot both answer a call."
msgstr ""

msgid "Incoming call notifications"
msgstr ""

msgid "A phone whose SIP client has been suspended by the system (iOS does this to any app in the background) has no registration, so Asterisk cannot ring it at all. A push notification wakes the phone; opening the client re-registers it and the call is rung while it still rings. Messages are sent through ntfy, which needs no account."
msgstr ""

msgid "Send a notification"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sends one message per incoming call, with the caller's number."
msgstr ""

msgid "ntfy server"
msgstr ""

msgid "The server to post to. Use https://ntfy.sh, or your own if you run one."
msgstr ""

msgid "Topic"
msgstr ""

msgid "The topic your phone subscribes to in the ntfy app. Anyone who knows it can read the messages, so pick something unguessable."
msgstr ""

msgid "Access token"
msgstr ""

msgid "Only for a server with access control. Left empty, no token is sent."
msgstr ""

msgid "Open on tap"
msgstr ""

msgid "A link to open when the notification is tapped, instead of the ntfy app. Point it at a URI your softphone registers — for example <code>sip:100@192.168.8.1</code>, or the app's own scheme such as <code>linphone:</code> or <code>zoiper:</code>. One tap then opens the client and re-registers it. Does nothing if no app claims that URI. Leave empty to keep opening the ntfy app."
msgstr ""

msgid "Topic password"
msgstr ""

msgid "Encrypts the message end to end, so the server only stores ciphertext. Set the same password on the topic in the app (topic menu, End-to-end encryption). Left empty, the message is sent in the clear and anyone who knows the topic can read it."
msgstr ""

msgid "SIP accounts"
msgstr ""

msgid "Phones that register to Asterisk on this device. The dialplan sends every call to the mobile network, and incoming mobile calls ring all accounts at once. Leave the password empty to have one generated."
msgstr ""

