msgid "Audio"
msgstr ""

msgid "Jitter buffer (ms)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Audio from the phones is buffered this long before it is played into the call. Raise it if the far end hears choppy speech over Wi-Fi; lower it to reduce delay. 40 ms suits a wired or good Wi-Fi link."
msgstr ""

msgid "PCM rate"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sample rate of the in-call audio device. 48 kHz gives 10 ms periods, which is what the DSP expects."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mute the unused microphone port"
msgstr ""

msgid "Keeps the internal Bluetooth SCO microphone out of the call, so only the phones supply uplink audio."
msgstr ""

msgid "Log audio statistics"
msgstr ""

msgid "Writes a voicebridge statistics line to the system log every 5 seconds. Useful when diagnosing choppy audio; leave off otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bluetooth headset"
msgstr ""

msgid "Headset address"
msgstr ""

msgid "MAC address of the headset to connect to, e.g. 00:11:22:33:44:55. Pair it first with bluetoothctl."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reconnect backoff (seconds)"
msgstr ""

msgid "How long to keep paging a disconnected headset, doubling from 60 s. Each page briefly blinds the Wi-Fi station (shared 2.4 GHz radio). 0 never pages."
msgstr ""

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr ""

msgid "Voice session"
msgstr ""

msgid "DSP voice path used for call audio. Auto picks VoLTE while IMS is registered and the circuit-switched session otherwise."
msgstr ""

